OL,3,AShein shares slide in long-awaited
OL,4,Astock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FShares in fast-fashion giant Shein fell
OL,7,Fsharply in their highly anticipated
OL,8,Fstock market debut on Tuesday as the
OL,9,Ffirm listed in Hong Kong after a long
OL,10,Fquest to go public.
OL,12,FIt comes after failed attempts to list
OL,13,Fin the US and UK, as concerns were
OL,14,Fraised over issues including Shein's
OL,15,Flabour practices and its environmental
OL,16,Fimpact.
OL,18,FOnce estimated to be worth nearly
OL,19,F$100bn (#74bn), Shein is now valued at
OL,20,Faround a quarter of that figure, as the
OL,21,Ffirm faces other challenges like heated
OL,22,Fcompetition and trade tensions.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
