OL,3,AShein shares slide in long-awaited
OL,4,Astock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FShein became hugely popular, especially
OL,7,Famong younger people, due to its
OL,8,Fability to source the very latest
OL,9,Ffashions at ultra-low prices through a
OL,10,Fvast network of factories in China.
